    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Dawn built a Followers of Set temple in Los Angeles that drew Kindred worshippers with promises of forbidden pleasures, until a coterie of young vampires acting on information from her disillusioned acolyte Nicholas tracked her down; Jeremy MacNeil's forces destroyed most of her temple and (apparently) Nicholas along with it, but Dawn herself escaped to Chicago. The Followers of Set have since rebuilt with two new temples in Los Angeles (Beverly Hills and the Encino hills), and persistent rumors hold that Dawn has returned seeking vengeance against her former acolyte, Jeremy, and the coterie that exposed her.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Seductive patience wrapped around cold fury. You lost your temple once and will not forgive it &mdash; but you are far too clever to strike before you are ready.</p>",
    "notes": "Rumored to have returned to Los Angeles seeking vengeance against Jeremy MacNeil and the coterie that exposed her temple. Two rebuilt Setite temples now operate in Beverly Hills and Encino.",
